Rule 3 (valid input and other tensors in QFunctional.mul)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≥ 1 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0)
>>
Rule 6 (tensor shapes must match for multiplication)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0)
